abstract: >-
  Curatom Polyglot is open-source DeepTech software by Yash Rajvansh and
  Comfort Curators Private Limited: owner-controlled capability infrastructure
  for granting machines temporary, narrowly scoped authority, executing across
  explicit trust boundaries, and recording outcomes without exposing the
  operator's underlying credentials.
